              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every day your fleet is on the road, Florida's economy keeps moving. But when one truck breaks down, everything from deliveries to drivers' schedules gets thrown off.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A single truck breakdown can cost fleets hundreds per day in lost revenue. When you add in missed delivery windows, unhappy customers, and the stress placed on drivers, the true cost of downtime is much higher. That's why having a reliable partner for fleet truck service in Florida isn't just helpful; it's critical.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we're here to help you reduce downtime, extend the life of your trucks, and keep your business moving forward with our fleet repair services.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-difference",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Sun State International Difference",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "difference"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-difference-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all service providers are the same. While many shops can handle basic maintenance, few offer the professionalism, scale, and customer-first service that Sun State International delivers. Here's what sets us apart:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-difference-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Trained technicians: our team is trained directly by International®, giving us the expertise to handle everything from simple oil changes to complex engine diagnostics"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "OEM parts access: we stock and source genuine parts built to last, reducing the risk of repeat repairs and helping your fleet meet compliance standards"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Multiple locations across Florida: service centers in Tampa, Sarasota, Davenport, and Brooksville"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Transparent communication: we keep the process simple, straightforward, and focused on getting you back on the road quickly"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-maintenance-built",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Florida Fleet Maintenance Built Around You",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "maintenance-built"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-maintenance-built-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fleet managers and owner-operators don't just need repairs; they need a service partner who understands their day-to-day challenges. Whether you're running a handful of trucks or managing hundreds, our services are designed to scale with your business. Our fleet truck service in Florida includes:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-maintenance-built-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Preventive maintenance programs: tailored schedules that reduce unexpected breakdowns"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Advanced diagnostics and repairs: identifying and fixing issues before they turn into major problems"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake, tire, and safety inspections: ensuring your trucks stay compliant and safe on the road"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Mobile service: when breakdowns happen on the road, we'll send a team out to you"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "After hours service: our Certified Fleet Team is there when you need us most"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Custom service solutions: flexible programs for both small fleets and large corporations"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-maintenance-built-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "By working with Sun State International, you'll have the confidence that every truck in your fleet is receiving consistent, dependable care. Need reliable truck service in Florida today? Contact us here to schedule maintenance for your fleet.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-maintenance-built-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
