                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-fleets-choose",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Florida Fleets Choose Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-fleets-choose"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-fleets-choose-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Florida truckers come to Sun State International for more than quick fixes. They come for peace of mind. Whether it's national brands or Florida-based owner-operators, fleets choose us because of our reputation for professionalism, reliability, and hospitality.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-fleets-choose-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For both owner-operators and fleet managers, Sun State International provides solutions that reduce costs and extend uptime. What our clients appreciate most is that we treat their business as if it were our own. We know that when your trucks are on the road, your business is thriving, and when they're not, you need answers fast.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-preventive-saves",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Preventive Fleet Repair Services Save Florida Fleets Money",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "preventive-saves"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-preventive-saves-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fleet service isn't just about fixing problems as they happen. It's about building long-term reliability into your operations. Preventive maintenance may feel like an expense up front, but it saves significantly in the long run.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-preventive-saves-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International works with Florida fleets to design maintenance schedules that match their business model, ensuring every truck is optimized for longevity and compliance. By focusing on safety, uptime, and cost savings, we help you protect your bottom line.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-partnering",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Partnering With Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "partnering"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-partnering-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we know that choosing a service partner is about more than price. It's about trust, reliability, and the confidence that your trucks will be taken care of the right way, every time. With service centers across Florida and a legacy of helping fleets succeed, Sun State International is the partner you can trust to keep your business moving.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-partnering-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready to reduce downtime and improve fleet performance? With Sun State, you're not just choosing a service provider; you're choosing a partner who knows what's at stake.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
